{"id": "60051", "title": "不OX不成人", "author": "dove小妖", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 5, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/60/60051.htm", "intro": "属性分类：架空／其他／未定／幻想\r\n\r\n关键字：养成 　十八禁 　人兽 \r\n\r\n文案：\r\n\r\n神兽白虎为了变身“吃了”乖乖小白羊。\r\n\r\n反反复复吃不够，吃到再也离不了。\r\n\r\n小白羊和大白虎磕磕绊绊、“嗯嗯爱爱”的感情历程。\r\n\r\n敬请期待。\r\n\r\n偷偷预告：十八禁、人兽、兽兽，期待的，应有尽有。", "base": "files/article/html/60/60051", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "8799951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "8799953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "8799956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "8799959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-43", "file": "8799961.html", "available": false}]}